---
// A rich-formatted specialist reply — memory + real work, not a chat window.
---

<div
  class="tg-card tg"
  role="img"
  aria-label="Telegram reply from coach, a health specialist that remembers you: it reports your week's training load in bold, recalls last Thursday's ride, and suggests the same zone 2 session."
>
  <div class="tg-head" aria-hidden="true">
    <span class="tg-ava a3">co</span>
    <span class="who"><b>coach</b><span>bot</span></span>
    <span class="dots">⋮</span>
  </div>
  <div class="tg-body" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="msg out">
      <p>coach, what's the plan this week?</p>
      <span class="meta">7:01 <span class="ticks">✓✓</span></span>
    </div>
    <div class="msg in" style="max-width:92%">
      <span class="name">coach</span>
      <p><b>Load's trending up 8% — right in the band.</b></p>
      <p>Same shape as last week, since Thursday's zone 2 ride felt good:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Tue — intervals, 4×8min</li>
        <li>Thu — zone 2, 90min</li>
        <li>Sat — long ride with the group</li>
      </ul>
      <p>Sleep score's 84 this morning, so intervals are on.</p>
      <span class="meta">7:02</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
